 666+ 83A1              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 667+ 83A1              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 668+ 83A1              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 669+ 83A1              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 670+ 83A1                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 671+ 83A1                  ; Byte 2:
 672+ 83A1 3A F0 CC         ld   a, (player_score + 2)
